      "widgets_values": [
        "{\"version\": 1, \"content\": \"<h2>MODELS AND NODES USED IN THIS WORKFLOW</h2><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #777777\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><h3><span data-ic=\\\"workflow-v1\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;How this works</h3><p>\\n\\n</p><ol>\\n  <li>Run one of the <b>Image to 3D Model</b> workflows first. It writes a <code>.glb</code> into <code>ComfyUI/output/3d</code>.</li>\\n  <li>On the <b>Load 3D</b> node press <b>upload 3d model</b> and pick that <code>.glb</code>. ComfyUI copies it into <code>input/3d</code> so the node can see it.</li>\\n  <li><b>Drag inside the 3D view to rotate</b> to the angle you want, then press Run.</li>\\n</ol><p>\\n\\n</p><p>Flux Klein redraws that angle as a finished picture. Because it is always the same 3D model, every angle you render is the <span style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\">same object</span>, which is what you cannot get by asking an image model for another view.</p><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #777777\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><h3><span data-ic=\\\"model-v4\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Load Diffusion Model</h3><p>\\n\\n<span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\"><a class=\\\"pix-note-dl\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://huggingface.co/Winnougan/Klein9b-Distilled-Base-INT8-Convrot/resolve/main/flux-2-klein-9b-int8-convrot.safetensors\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Download flux-2-klein-9b-int8-convrot.safetensors<span class=\\\"pix-note-btnsize\\\">9.4 GB</span></a></span>&nbsp;\\n\\n</p><div class=\\\"pix-note-folderhint\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\">Place in: ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models/flux2</div><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #777777\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><h3><span data-ic=\\\"CLIP\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Load CLIP</h3><p>\\n\\n<span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"pix-note-dl\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-klein-9B/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Download qwen_3_8b_fp8mixed.safetensors<span class=\\\"pix-note-btnsize\\\">8.06 GB</span></a>\\n</span>&nbsp;\\n\\n</p><div class=\\\"pix-note-folderhint\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\">Place in: ComfyUI/models/text_encoders</div><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #777777\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><h3><span data-ic=\\\"VAE\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Load VAE</h3><p>\\n\\n<span class=\\\"pix-note-btnblock\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"pix-note-dl\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #f66744\\\" href=\\\"https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/flux2-dev/resolve/main/split_files/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Download flux2-vae.safetensors<span class=\\\"pix-note-btnsize\\\">320 MB</span></a>\\n</span>&nbsp;\\n\\n</p><div class=\\\"pix-note-folderhint\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\">Place in: ComfyUI/models/vae</div><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #777777\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><p><span data-ic=\\\"warning-v1\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;After placing the files, <span style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\">restart</span> ComfyUI or refresh model lists using <span style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\">R</span> shortcut.</p><p>\\n\\n</p><hr class=\\\"pix-note-hr-solid\\\" style=\\\"color: #777777\\\"><p>\\n\\n</p><h3><span data-ic=\\\"nodes-installed\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" contenteditable=\\\"false\\\" style=\\\"color: #f66744\\\"></span>&nbsp;Custom Nodes</h3><p>\\n\\n</p><ul>\\n  <li>Pix